{"text": "Ricitos subió a la habitación. Había tres camas. Probó las dos primeras y se acomodó en la más pequeña. Estaba cansada, cerró los ojos y se quedó dormida, sin haber pedido permiso a los dueños de la casa. Ricitos: Descansaré solo un ratito.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.729374, "from": 0, "to": 7}, {"start": 0.744125, "end": 1.128125, "from": 8, "to": 13}, {"start": 1.142875, "end": 1.1871659, "from": 14, "to": 15}, {"start": 1.201958, "end": 1.334874, "from": 16, "to": 18}, {"start": 1.349625, "end": 2.132333, "from": 19, "to": 29}, {"start": 3.160458, "end": 3.618291, "from": 31, "to": 36}, {"start": 3.633041, "end": 3.943166, "from": 37, "to": 41}, {"start": 3.957958, "end": 4.578249, "from": 42, "to": 47}, {"start": 5.59725, "end": 5.922166, "from": 49, "to": 54}, {"start": 5.936916, "end": 6.143666, "from": 55, "to": 58}, {"start": 6.158416, "end": 6.379957, "from": 59, "to": 62}, {"start": 6.39475, "end": 6.9855, "from": 63, "to": 71}, {"start": 7.00025, "end": 7.074083, "from": 72, "to": 73}, {"start": 7.088833, "end": 7.221749, "from": 74, "to": 76}, {"start": 7.236541, "end": 7.782957, "from": 77, "to": 84}, {"start": 7.79775, "end": 7.915916, "from": 85, "to": 87}, {"start": 7.930666, "end": 8.034041, "from": 88, "to": 90}, {"start": 8.048791, "end": 8.344166, "from": 91, "to": 94}, {"start": 8.358916, "end": 8.979207, "from": 95, "to": 102}, {"start": 9.998208, "end": 10.500333, "from": 104, "to": 110}, {"start": 10.515125, "end": 11.164916, "from": 111, "to": 118}, {"start": 11.489833, "end": 11.844291, "from": 120, "to": 125}, {"start": 11.859041, "end": 12.095332, "from": 126, "to": 129}, {"start": 12.110125, "end": 12.508875, "from": 130, "to": 134}, {"start": 12.523625, "end": 12.582708, "from": 135, "to": 136}, {"start": 12.597458, "end": 12.774666, "from": 137, "to": 139}, {"start": 12.789458, "end": 13.084833, "from": 140, "to": 145}, {"start": 13.099583, "end": 13.675541, "from": 146, "to": 153}, {"start": 14.000458, "end": 1